        <h1>AI Agents vs Automation: <em>What Do You Actually Need?</em></h1>
        <p class="dek">A plain-English decision guide for small and medium businesses. The real difference between automation and an AI agent, what each one costs, why most owners overbuy, and a simple flowchart to tell which your business actually needs.</p>
        <div class="byline"><span><b>Best Answer Hub</b></span><span>~8 min read</span><span>Vendor-neutral</span><span>No signup</span></div>
